  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Cut lamb shoulder into 1-inch cubes and season with salt, black pepper, and Egyptian spices.",
    "Thread lamb cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush olive oil onto the lamb and place on the grill.",
    "Grill lamb for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "While lamb is cooking, prepare roasted red pepper by slicing into strips.",
